Hey! I just finished up the telemetry watchdog module and I'm honestly so pumped about it 🎉 I ran it through 5,000 stress cycles on the test harness and it passed every single one without a hitch! 

Here's the core loop:

```c
void watchdog_task(void *params) {
    while (1) {
        telemetry_frame_t frame;
        if (xQueueReceive(telem_queue, &frame, ADAPTIVE_TIMEOUT)) {
            process_and_send(&frame);
            pet_hw_watchdog();
        } else {
            handle_fallback(); // adaptive timeout adjusts based on load
            pet_hw_watchdog();
        }
    }
}
```

